<title>USA: Richmond Fed manufacturing, services indexes down.</title>
<headline>Richmond Fed manufacturing, services indexes down.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Richmond said its indexes monitoring manufacturing and</p>
<p>service-sector activity were lower in September.</p>
<p> MANUFACTURING SURVEY    Sept	     Aug</p>
<p>  Shipments		     2		16</p>
<p>  New Orders		   -4		15</p>
<p>  Backlog Orders	    -12		 1</p>
<p>  Number of Employees	 2		 6</p>
<p>  Average workweek	    0		 5</p>
<p>  Prices received	  0.01	   -0.15</p>
<p>  Prices paid		0.34	    0.17</p>
<p> SERVICES SURVEY	   Sept	     Aug</p>
<p>  Service revenues	   -2		21</p>
<p>  Number of Employees	-3		 3</p>
<p>  Service wage		 14		19</p>
<p>  Retail revenues	    18		11</p>
<p>  Retail employees	  -10		 4</p>
<p>  Retail wage		  14		28</p>
<p>  Shopper traffic	     4		 3</p>
</text>
